OL,3,GNEWSAGive My Head Peace creators told
OL,4,Avia email show not returning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe creators of Give My Head Peace have
OL,7,Fsaid they were told by email that the
OL,8,Flong-running comedy show had not been
OL,9,Fcommissioned for a new series.
OL,11,FIt comes as the corporation faces
OL,12,F"significant financial pressures" and
OL,13,Fis attempting to save #500m over two
OL,14,Fyears.
OL,16,FTim McGarry, who plays Da, said the
OL,17,Fteam are "disappointed" by the news and
OL,18,F"a little bit hurt" at how they say it
OL,19,Fwas delivered.
OL,21,FThe Blame Game, which is presented by
OL,22,FMcGarry, will also not return.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
